dance Strobe
// The bass pushes the morph; the hi-hats bring it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and
// the middle turns it; drops in the kicks reverse it; drops in the snares switch its flat spin on
// and off.
// Inspired by stobe 2, a DancerDNA music style.

morph   follows music.bass  speed 0.8  settle 0.17
zoom    follows music.high_hit  amount 0.5  settle 1.67
spin    follows music.mid  from 80.2 to 252  smooth 0
turn    on music.mid changes  by 0.49
reverse on music.bass_hit drops  by 1  on 8 off 4
flat    on music.mid_hit drops  by 0.47  on 260 off 180
